    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDicey Heroes\u201d is a casual deck-building game that combines Monopoly and roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units move by rolling dice, and actions are triggered by the squares they stop on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a breakthrough, your army units have only one parameter: a number. This number serves as both attack power and life force; if it reaches 0, the unit dies. Simple, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to strengthen this number and defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a unit stops on a square, its effect is activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An \u201cattacking square\u201d attacks the enemy, an \u201cadding square\u201d increases the unit's number, and a \u201cmultiplying square\u201d doubles the unit's number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various types of squares, and by combining and strengthening them, you can defeat stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you can use items to strengthen your units and items to change the roll of the dice to whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemies will also attack you. Pay attention to the number of chains you have left; if it reaches zero, they will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and strengthen your squares to be able to cross with strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to experience a game that blends luck and strategy at a high level!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDicey Heroes\u201d is a casual deck-building game that combines Monopoly and roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units move by rolling dice, and actions are triggered by the squares they stop on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a breakthrough, your army units have only one parameter: a number. This number serves as both attack power and life force; if it reaches 0, the unit dies. Simple, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to strengthen this number and defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a unit stops on a square, its effect is activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An \u201cattacking square\u201d attacks the enemy, an \u201cadding square\u201d increases the unit's number, and a \u201cmultiplying square\u201d doubles the unit's number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various types of squares, and by combining and strengthening them, you can defeat stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you can use items to strengthen your units and items to change the roll of the dice to whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemies will also attack you. Pay attention to the number of chains you have left; if it reaches zero, they will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and strengthen your squares to be able to cross with strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to experience a game that blends luck and strategy at a high level!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dicey Heroes is a Monopoly-based roguelike deck-building casual game. Actions such as attack, reinforcement, and defense are determined according to the squares stopped by rolling dice. Units have only one parameter, a number. The objective of the game is to strengthen this number. Simple, isn't it?",
